    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i'll try the 325mg. but it's still throbbing so much and the burn area just feels so hot to the touch. if i don't want to go to the hospital, can i just wrap it in a thick layer of Vaseline or maybe some coconut oil after i pop the blisters so it doesn't get dry? i feel like keeping it moist and covered would help it heal faster.",
